# 64. Final Acceptance Criteria

Phase 03 is considered correctly implemented only if:

- [ ] GrowFlow has one unified design system.
- [ ] Soft Intelligence is clearly perceptible.
- [ ] Warm light is the default visual environment.
- [ ] Dark mode is a soft charcoal counterpart.
- [ ] Typography follows the Manrope-style direction.
- [ ] Color remains muted and restrained.
- [ ] There is one subtle primary brand accent.
- [ ] Surfaces form a soft neutral hierarchy.
- [ ] Cards remain quiet and purposeful.
- [ ] Tables are dense but integrated.
- [ ] Images are editorial/contextual.
- [ ] AI has a slightly deeper visual treatment without becoming a separate theme.
- [ ] Login has a distinct composition while remaining inside the system.
- [ ] Dashboards behave as visual data instruments.
- [ ] Public heroes use strong statements and visual storytelling.
- [ ] Scroll storytelling follows the Float → Settle philosophy where appropriate.
- [ ] Motion is subtle and physically coherent.
- [ ] Reduced-motion behavior exists.
- [ ] BUILD, SUPERVISE, and GOVERN do not receive separate color themes.
- [ ] Light and dark preserve the same identity.
- [ ] Loading, empty, error, success, warning, and disabled states are intentionally designed.
- [ ] Accessibility is built into the visual system.
- [ ] Mobile is structurally responsive.
- [ ] Visual complexity increases only when the information domain requires it.
- [ ] The interface never depends on decoration to communicate meaning.
- [ ] AI UI reflects real backend state.
- [ ] Long-running operations remain visually understandable after navigation.
- [ ] The design is performant enough for production.

