# 65. Phase 03 Freeze Statement

> **PHASE 03 — APPROVED / FROZEN**

The GrowFlow frontend visual direction is now defined as:

> **Soft Intelligence — a unified, warm, restrained, editorial and operational design system with subtle physical motion, strong information hierarchy, contextual imagery, quiet surfaces, integrated dense data interfaces, and a slightly deeper AI visual layer.**

The three roles—**BUILD, SUPERVISE, GOVERN**—share one identity.

Light and dark are two surface expressions of the same identity.

The public site may be expressive and cinematic.

The authenticated workplace should be calm, dense, clear, and productive.

AI should feel powerful through behavior, structure, and feedback—not through visual noise.

This document is the authoritative visual-design baseline for subsequent frontend implementation and Phase 04 documentation.

